-- CAPABILITY ------------ errors/cap_deserialize_1.march

`Cap(IO)` cannot be serialized — a capability may only be received, never constructed. [cap_deserialize]
hint: `to_json` places no constraint on the type it produces, so it would fabricate authority from data. Receive the capability as a parameter and pass it through instead.

20 |     println(to_json(cap))
                 ^^^^^^^^^^^^

    run `march --explain cap_deserialize`


